Snapshot dates and checksums are in SOURCES.json. The files are unmodified
copies of the upstream lists.

clearslip-sg.txt is Clearslip's own Singapore list: MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026
Vincent Wesley. It is not part of EasyList and is not downloaded.

Compiled rulesets derived from this data (the generated files in
rulesets/ and their maps) are adaptations of the EasyList data and, as a
whole, carry the same licence, CC BY-SA 3.0, with the same credit: "The
EasyList authors (https://easylist.to/)". The Clearslip source code itself is
